  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lime juice, garlic, ginger, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the smoked mackerel fillets to the bowl and marinate for 15 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated mackerel onto the soaked wooden skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8 minutes, turning occasionally, until the mackerel is cooked through.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with fresh cilantro and lime wedges.",
    "Offer a side of quinoa or brown rice to complement the dish.",
    "Garnish with sliced avocado for added creaminess.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
